{"data":{"body":"[P2] Detect the marker without building an unmarked payload tree\n\nPass-through payloads are parsed into a full `JsonNode` merely to determine that they lack the filesystem marker, after which the root codec parses them again. Large raw invoke or callback results can therefore incur duplicate document allocation and fail before reaching the value codec. Scan top-level field names with a streaming parser and build the envelope tree only when the reserved marker is found.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ogA7l","finding_digest":"298172604316e7313d491694b9ac63cc0469d6592b10cfc6aa0b898e9cec69cf","finding_id":"arf_v1_fgaxeycdc3ttcpkjc2kltlddzq","finding_key":"filesystem-serdes-stage::resolve-serialized-payload::unmarked-payload-materialization","identity_key":"filesystem-serdes-stage::resolve-serialized-payload::unmarked-payload-materialization","line":139,"observation_digest":"2edaeaae0a5042d61846d4d886bebe73115323c801152dea2e28785cde1094ef","observation_id":"aro_v1_f3novlqkkbbnmgcg2tminpv6om","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/FileSystemSerDesStage.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T04:12:32Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tb7tctryogk3ld253sdhjwzl32","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"f001a8f1de90bbda6c82b737ad83e0252bf513d0","reviewer":"codex","start_line":139,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_m6ekdpfnml5335mmxn7eej5nkw","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T04:12:32Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
